<title>USA: AutoInfo Inc names Scott Zecher CEO.</title>
<headline>AutoInfo Inc names Scott Zecher CEO.</headline>
<dateline>FAIR LAWN, N.J. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>AutoInfo Inc said on Tuesday its board had elected Scott Zecher as chief executive officer, a post that has been vacant since April 1995.</p>
<p>Zecher, who joined AutoInfo in 1984 as chief financial officer, became president and chief operating officer in January 1993, said AutoInfo, a company specializing in auto loans.</p>
<p>Jason Bacher was the company's previous chief executive officer. He resigned to work for Automatic Data Processing Inc, an AutoInfo spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
